    "TRANS-UNANCHORED": {}
   },
   "notes": [
    "script delta without the anchor majority"
   ],
   "partial_notes": [],
   "first_removed": "The header will automatically be translated on the **CN**, **FR**, **JP**, **KO**, **PL**, **VN** and **ZH**[[footnote]]To keep things consistent between CN and ZH, the wording from the CN translation of the Site-418 dossier is used as the standard.[[/footnote]] wikis, as those are the wikis on which at least one Minecraft Division translation exists. If you are from a branch not listed and translate an article from the Minecraft Division, please send me ([[*user tetsusquared]]) a Wikidot PM with a link to the article so I can \"officialize\" your translation of the theme. In the meantime, you may override the {{header-title}} and {{header-subtitle}} parameters until I get to it.",
   "first_added": "このテーマを翻訳された場合は、私（[[*user tetsusquared]]）にWikidotのPMを送ってください。テーマの更新情報をお伝えします。なお、更新を継続して受け取るには、静的に複製したコードではなく、このページをincludeしてください。"
  },
